====== COMFAST CF-EW72 ======

{{media:comfast:cf-ew72-device-front-view.jpg?0x200}}


The COMFAST CF-EW72 is an outdoor 2.4 GHz and 5 GHz wireless CPE. It is based on the Qualcomm Atheros QCA9531 SoC, with an additional Qualcomm Atheros QCA9886.  It features two RJ45 10/100 Mbps Ethernet ports with 802.3af/802.3at PoE, a 300 Mbps 2.4 GHz 802.11b/g/n radio and an 867 Mbps 5 GHz 802.11a/n/ac radio with dual external 5 dBi antenna.

This OpenWrt build works with the <color #ed1c24>**COMFAST CF-EW71 v2.6**</color>, too (identical device, but only 2.4 ghz radio).  There is new device specific firmware for CF-EW71 v2 advise to use those - https://firmware-selector.openwrt.org/?version=SNAPSHOT&target=ath79%2Fgeneric&id=comfast_cf-ew71-v2.


